# Repository Agent Defaults

- Follow `AGENTS.md`; do not preload lifecycle documents.
- Do not plan routine changes or repeat plans on each prompt, including Android Studio work.
- Probe potentially large files with `scripts/context_probe.py` before loading them. For logs and append-only histories, search or read the newest chunk first and page backward only as needed.
- Use targeted checks and bounded output. Ask before optional extreme-context reads, repository-wide analysis, full validation expansion, or more than two failed fix/retest cycles.
- Update handoffs once only when durable context changes. Use `MULTI_AGENT.md` only for actual concurrency.
